{"seq":1,"slug":"creative-performance-attribution","title":"素材效果与转化归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-performance-loop/creative-performance-attribution","wordCount":2121,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"素材效果与转化归因\">素材效果与转化归因</h1><p>素材库里最有价值的信号是&quot;这张图带来了多少转化&quot;。这个信号的标准形式看起来简单——曝光、点击、转化、花费四个数——但从渠道报告回到单个素材甚至单个变体的粒度，中间隔着渠道的归因窗口、跨渠道的指标口径差异、以及&quot;高转化素材往往投在高价流量上&quot;这一根本性的混淆。这一节给出把效果数据可靠地锚定到素材粒度的工程方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从渠道标识到素材标识的映射链\">核心概念：从渠道标识到素材标识的映射链</h2><p>效果数据进入系统的第一件事是解引用：渠道报告给的是它自己的素材标识，本地需要的是 <code>version_id</code> 甚至更细的变体标识。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  CH[&quot;渠道效果报告&lt;br/&gt;impressions/clicks/conversions/spend&quot;] --&gt; M1[&quot;external_ref → distribution_id&quot;]&#10;  M1 --&gt; M2[&quot;distribution_id → version_id&quot;]&#10;  M2 --&gt; M3[&quot;version_id → asset_id&quot;]&#10;  M3 --&gt; F[&quot;素材级效果事实表&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; AGG1[&quot;按素材聚合&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; AGG2[&quot;按变体维度聚合&lt;br/&gt;版式/色调/文案句式&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; ATT[&quot;归因模型&lt;br/&gt;去混淆&quot;]&#10;  ATT --&gt; SCORE[&quot;performance_score&lt;br/&gt;写回素材库&quot;]\">graph TD\n  CH[\"渠道效果报告&lt;br/&gt;impressions/clicks/conversions/spend\"] --&gt; M1[\"external_ref → distribution_id\"]\n  M1 --&gt; M2[\"distribution_id → version_id\"]\n  M2 --&gt; M3[\"version_id → asset_id\"]\n  M3 --&gt; F[\"素材级效果事实表\"]\n  F --&gt; AGG1[\"按素材聚合\"]\n  F --&gt; AGG2[\"按变体维度聚合&lt;br/&gt;版式/色调/文案句式\"]\n  F --&gt; ATT[\"归因模型&lt;br/&gt;去混淆\"]\n  ATT --&gt; SCORE[\"performance_score&lt;br/&gt;写回素材库\"]</pre><p>映射链上任何一环断裂，效果数据就会变成孤立的渠道数字。第 3 章的 <a href=\"../creative-approval-flow/asset-publish-channel-distribute\">审批后多渠道分发</a> 已经要求写入时用唯一约束保证一对一映射，这里的工程重点是处理映射不完备时的补救与标记，而不是假装它不存在。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事实表的设计\">事实表的设计</h3><p>效果事实表的粒度选择是本节最重要的建模决策。太粗（按素材聚合）会丢失时间维度，无法做趋势分析；太细（按小时）会产生巨大的数据量且长尾部分几乎全是零。实践中用<strong>日级 × 素材 × 渠道位置</strong>作为主粒度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE creative_performance_daily (&#10;  stat_date       date NOT NULL,&#10;  distribution_id bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES distribution(distribution_id),&#10;  version_id      bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  asset_id        bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  market          text NOT NULL,&#10;  channel         text NOT NULL,&#10;  placement       text NOT NULL,&#10;  impressions     bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  clicks          bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  conversions     numeric(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  spend_micros    bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  revenue_micros  bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  view_through_conversions numeric(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  source_revision text NOT NULL,&#10;  ingested_at     timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (stat_date, distribution_id)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX perf_by_version ON creative_performance_daily (version_id, stat_date DESC);&#10;CREATE INDEX perf_by_asset   ON creative_performance_daily (asset_id, stat_date DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> creative_performance_daily</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stat_date       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distribution_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(distribution_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  placement       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  impressions     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  clicks          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  conversions     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  spend_micros    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revenue_micros  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  view_through_conversions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_revision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ingested_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stat_date, distribution_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> perf_by_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creative_performance_daily (version_id, stat_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> perf_by_asset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creative_performance_daily (asset_id, stat_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>source_revision</code> 记录这批数据来自渠道报告的哪个修订版本。渠道数据经常回溯修正（点击欺诈清理、转化回传延迟、归因窗口到期的补记），因此写入必须是<strong>幂等覆盖</strong>而非追加：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO creative_performance_daily AS t&#10;  (stat_date, distribution_id, version_id, asset_id, market, channel, placement,&#10;   impressions, clicks, conversions, spend_micros, revenue_micros, source_revision)&#10;VALUES (...)&#10;ON CONFLICT (stat_date, distribution_id) DO UPDATE&#10;   SET impressions = EXCLUDED.impressions,&#10;       clicks      = EXCLUDED.clicks,&#10;       conversions = EXCLUDED.conversions,&#10;       spend_micros = EXCLUDED.spend_micros,&#10;       revenue_micros = EXCLUDED.revenue_micros,&#10;       source_revision = EXCLUDED.source_revision,&#10;       ingested_at = now()&#10; WHERE t.source_revision IS DISTINCT FROM EXCLUDED.source_revision;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creative_performance_daily </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (stat_date, distribution_id, version_id, asset_id, market, channel, placement,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   impressions, clicks, conversions, spend_micros, revenue_micros, source_revision)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (stat_date, distribution_id) DO </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> impressions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">impressions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       clicks      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clicks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       conversions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">conversions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       spend_micros </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">spend_micros</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       revenue_micros </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">revenue_micros</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       source_revision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_revision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ingested_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_revision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_revision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>WHERE</code> 子句里的 <code>IS DISTINCT FROM</code> 让相同修订的重复拉取变成空操作，避免无意义地重写整天的数据。这个模式与 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/asset-version-rights-license\">版本/版权/授权有效期管理</a> 里&quot;只更新真正发生迁移的行&quot;是同一思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因窗口与口径对齐\">归因窗口与口径对齐</h2><h3 id=\"归因窗口的差异\">归因窗口的差异</h3><p>不同渠道对&quot;一次转化归功于哪次点击&quot;的判定窗口不同，从当天到几十天不等，且区分点击归因与曝光归因。同一批用户在不同窗口下会被算给不同素材，直接对比会得出错误结论。</p>\n<p>工程上的处理是<strong>记录窗口而不试图统一</strong>：事实表里的 <code>conversions</code> 是渠道在其默认窗口下给出的数字，附加一份窗口元数据；本地汇总时按窗口分桶，绝不把不同窗口的转化数直接相加。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>判定口径</th>\n<th>是否需要分窗口汇总</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>impressions</td>\n<td>素材被展示</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>把渠道去重曝光与总曝光混用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>clicks</td>\n<td>素材被点击</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>忘了砍掉无效点击的修正量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>conversions（点击归因）</td>\n<td>点击后窗口内转化</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>与曝光归因版相加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>conversions（曝光归因）</td>\n<td>仅曝光后窗口内转化</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>当作增量转化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>view_through_conversions</td>\n<td>曝光归因且无点击</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>与点击归因混为一谈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>spend</td>\n<td>消耗金额</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>币种未换算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行提醒一个容易忽视的问题：多市场场景下各渠道报告的币种不同，汇总前必须统一。汇率的时点选择（日终中间价 vs 实时）应当固定并记录，否则同一份数据在不同时间得到不同结论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隐私环境下的归因变化\">隐私环境下的归因变化</h3><p>浏览器端归因正在从&quot;跨站标识追踪&quot;转向&quot;聚合上报&quot;。以隐私沙盒的 Attribution Reporting API 为例，它的设计目标是让广告主与广告技术平台在不做侵入式跨站追踪的前提下衡量转化，做法是浏览器生成报告：事件级报告把单次广告事件与转化数据关联，聚合级报告把大量用户的测量合并；隐私保护靠对聚合测量加噪声、设置贡献预算与归因规则来实现 <a href=\"https://privacysandbox.google.com/private-advertising/attribution-reporting\">Privacy Sandbox Attribution Reporting</a>。</p>\n<p>这对素材归因的含义是：素材级数据的可获得性会下降——聚合报告天然不能精确到单个素材的精确转化数。可行的应对是把抽样粒度从&quot;每素材精确值&quot;调整为&quot;每素材特征组的聚合估计&quot;，即按版式、色调、文案句式这些可枚举的创意特征分组，让统计量落在特征组而不是单素材上。这也正是下一篇 <a href=\"winning-asset-reuse-signal\">高效素材识别与复用推荐</a> 采用的工作粒度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去混淆-创意效果的基本困难\">去混淆：创意效果的基本困难</h2><p>素材效果数据天生是被污染的实验。假设素材 A 投在黄金位置、素材 B 投在长尾位置，A 的转化率更高，但这可能完全是位置的功劳。如果系统据此把 A 标记为&quot;高效素材&quot;并推荐复用，就是在放大一个与创意无关的差异。</p>\n<p>混淆有三个主要来源：</p>\n<p><strong>位置混淆。</strong> 素材被分配到不同质量的流量。渠道的自动优化机制会主动把高转化素材推到更好的位置，这形成正反馈——高转化素材获得更多曝光，曝光又验证了它高转化。</p>\n<p><strong>时间混淆。</strong> 大促期间的素材天然比淡季的转化率高。如果两条素材的投放期不重叠，比较就无意义。</p>\n<p><strong>人群混淆。</strong> 定向到不同人群的素材本质上在做不同的实验，转化率不可比。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分离手段\">分离手段</h3><p>工程上有三层手段，从弱到强：</p>\n<p><strong>第一层，分层对比。</strong> 按（渠道，位置，周）分桶，桶内比较素材。这消除了位置与时间的部分混淆，但仍遗留桶内的分配偏差。实现上就是一次带窗口函数的排名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH stratified AS (&#10;  SELECT d.version_id,&#10;         p.channel,&#10;         p.placement,&#10;         date_trunc(&#39;week&#39;, p.stat_date) AS wk,&#10;         SUM(p.impressions) AS imp,&#10;         SUM(p.conversions) AS conv,&#10;         SUM(p.spend_micros) AS spend&#10;    FROM creative_performance_daily p&#10;    JOIN distribution d USING (distribution_id)&#10;   WHERE p.stat_date &gt;= :from AND p.stat_date &lt; :to&#10;   GROUP BY 1,2,3,4&#10;)&#10;SELECT version_id, channel, placement, wk,&#10;       (conv / NULLIF(imp,0)) AS cvr,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY conv / NULLIF(imp,0))&#10;         OVER (PARTITION BY channel, placement, wk) AS bucket_median,&#10;       cvr / NULLIF(bucket_median, 0) AS lift_vs_bucket&#10;  FROM (SELECT *, conv / NULLIF(imp,0) AS cvr FROM stratified) s;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stratified </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">placement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wk,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">impressions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> imp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">conversions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conv,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">spend_micros</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creative_performance_daily p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (distribution_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id, channel, placement, wk,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(imp,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cvr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(imp,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel, placement, wk) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_median,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       cvr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bucket_median, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lift_vs_bucket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(imp,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cvr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stratified) s;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>lift_vs_bucket</code> 是相对同桶中位数的提升倍数，它比绝对转化率可比性更好，因为它把桶的共同水平消掉了。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层，随机化。</strong> 在同一位置、同一人群、同一时段内随机把流量分配给不同素材。这是唯一能从根上消除位置与人群混淆的方法。广告平台通常不直接提供完美的随机分配，但商业平台的创意实验能力与自建的落地页 A/B 系统可以近似实现。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层，增量测量。</strong> 用对照组的沉默区（holdout）测量素材的因果增量，而不是相关性的转化率。成本最高，只在少数高价值素材上做。</p>\n<p>判断当前该用哪一层的一个实用准则是看数据量：曝光量足够做分层对比但不足以做随机化时，就用分层对比并明确标注&quot;相关性证据&quot;；素材效果要写回素材库作为复用依据时，应当至少满足第二层的条件，否则宁可不写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写回素材库\">写回素材库</h2><p>归因的产出是 <code>performance_score</code>，它写回素材库供检索排序与复用推荐使用（见 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/creative-asset-library-tag\">素材库模型与多维标签</a>）。写回时必须携带可信度，而不是只有一个分数——一个由 200 次曝光得出的高分与由 20 万次曝光得出的高分，复用价值完全不同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version_id&quot;: 55120,&#10;  &quot;window&quot;: { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;2026-08-01&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;2026-09-25&quot;, &quot;attribution&quot;: &quot;click_7d&quot; },&#10;  &quot;metrics&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;impressions&quot;: 184320,&#10;    &quot;clicks&quot;: 4127,&#10;    &quot;conversions&quot;: 213.4,&#10;    &quot;spendMicros&quot;: 982000000,&#10;    &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;derived&quot;: { &quot;ctr&quot;: 0.0224, &quot;cvr&quot;: 0.0517, &quot;cpaMicros&quot;: 4602000, &quot;liftVsBucket&quot;: 1.34 },&#10;  &quot;confidence&quot;: { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;medium&quot;, &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;stratified_observational&quot;, &quot;minBucketImpressions&quot;: 5000, &quot;buckets&quot;: 18 },&#10;  &quot;evidenceTier&quot;: &quot;correlational&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-08-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"attribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"click_7d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"impressions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">184320</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"clicks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4127</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"conversions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">213.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"spendMicros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">982000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"derived\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ctr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cvr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0517</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cpaMicros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4602000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"liftVsBucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.34</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stratified_observational\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minBucketImpressions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"buckets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidenceTier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"correlational\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>evidenceTier</code> 取 <code>correlational</code>（分层观测）或 <code>experimental</code>（随机实验）是必要的字段：下游的复用推荐对不同层级的证据给不同权重，实验级证据可以驱动自动复用，观测级证据只能作为人工决策的参考。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>效果数据靠映射链锚定到素材：<code>external_ref → distribution_id → version_id → asset_id</code>，断链部分要标记而不是忽略。</li>\n<li>事实表用日级 × 素材 × 渠道位置为粒度，写入用幂等覆盖，<code>source_revision</code> 防止重复修订重写。</li>\n<li>归因窗口因渠道而异，记录而不统一；不同窗口的转化数不可相加，币种必须统一并固定汇率时点。</li>\n<li>隐私环境下聚合上报会削弱素材级精确度，对应策略是把统计粒度降到创意特征组。</li>\n<li>创意效果受位置、时间、人群三重混淆，分层对比是最低可用手段，随机化才能支撑自动复用决策。</li>\n<li>写回素材库的分数必须携带可信度与证据层级，观测级证据不得驱动自动复用。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"winning-asset-reuse-signal\">高效素材识别与复用推荐</a> 消费本节产出的指标；分发侧的映射设计见 <a href=\"../creative-approval-flow/asset-publish-channel-distribute\">审批后多渠道分发</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"素材效果与转化归因","id":"素材效果与转化归因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从渠道标识到素材标识的映射链","id":"核心概念-从渠道标识到素材标识的映射链"},{"level":3,"text":"事实表的设计","id":"事实表的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"归因窗口与口径对齐","id":"归因窗口与口径对齐"},{"level":3,"text":"归因窗口的差异","id":"归因窗口的差异"},{"level":3,"text":"隐私环境下的归因变化","id":"隐私环境下的归因变化"},{"level":2,"text":"去混淆：创意效果的基本困难","id":"去混淆-创意效果的基本困难"},{"level":3,"text":"分离手段","id":"分离手段"},{"level":2,"text":"写回素材库","id":"写回素材库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"审批后多渠道分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-approval-flow/asset-publish-channel-distribute"},"next":{"title":"高效素材识别与复用推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-performance-loop/winning-asset-reuse-signal"}}